<title>RUSSIA: List of frozen Russian MinFin bonds.</title>
<headline>List of frozen Russian MinFin bonds.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following lists Russian MinFin bonds frozen in June by a Moscow district prosecutor's office (total face value $56.81 million):</p>
<p>Tranche 4, $100,000 denomination 0173668 - 0173711 0175509 - 0175533 0176321 - 0176350 0181439 - 0181463 0181565 - 0181574 0189347 - 0189457 0191974 - 0191983 0193115 - 0193151</p>
<p>Tranche 4, $10,000 denomination 0117650 - 0117663 0126871 - 0126880</p>
<p>Tranche 4, $1,000 denomination 0045636 - 0045649 0066328 - 0066337</p>
<p>Tranche 5, $100,000 denomination 0195648 - 0195651 0196357 - 0196362 0197189 0197195 - 0197199 0197581 - 0197616 0199080 - 0199104 0200503 - 0200507 0201015 - 0201017 0202039 - 0202040 0202314 - 0202315 0202423 - 0202425 0202489 0204442 0206132 - 0206143 0210409 - 0210518 0213166 - 0213186 0213507 - 0213536 0214334 - 0214337</p>
<p>Tranche 5, $10,000 denomination 0131761 - 0131771 0140484 - 0140493</p>
<p>Tranche 5, $1,000 denomination 0077494 - 0077510 0098279 - 0098296</p>
<p>The following lists bonds frozen between March and May according to a list released by the Finance Ministry in July (total face value $24.22 million): 0004923 - 0004940 0013302 - 0013317 0016572 - 0016588 0026119 - 0026129 0026714 - 0026722 0027753 - 0027767 0028960 - 0028977 0029825 - 0029839 0043170 - 0043172 0052246 - 0052257 0053935 - 0053948 0066126 - 0066134, 0140320 - 0140332 0066328 - 0066337 0084016 - 0084031 0085688 - 0085702 0098073 - 0098086 0098088 0098279 - 0098296 0104757 0106033 - 0106035 0107816 - 0107824 0108721 0108723 0110033 0110989 0116661 0120785 - 0120800 0121699 - 0121708 0126698 - 0126704 0126871 - 0126880 0134629 - 0134646 0135490 - 0135506 0140484 - 0140493 0146971 0148353 0151173 - 0151185 0155593 - 0155605 0156909 - 0156910 0163525 0163534 0164198 - 0164210 0168292 0168295 - 0168307 0169675 - 0169680 0173110 - 0173115 0179242 - 0179282 0181703 - 0181708 0193115 - 0193151 0197140 - 0197145 0202109 - 0202141 0204109 - 0204112 0213507 - 0213536 NOTE - The following bonds appear on both lists (total face value $6.93 million): 0066328 - 0066337 0098279 - 0098296 0126871 - 0126880 0140484 - 0140493 0193115 - 0193151 0213507 - 0213536</p>
<p>--Artyom Danielyan, Moscow newsroom (095) 941 8520</p>
